# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the ASan CI job (go test -asan).
#
# libx265 3.5 (Ubuntu 24.04's libx265-199) allocates a zoneParam x265_param
# in x265_encoder_open and never frees it (source/encoder/api.cpp: it is
# used only as a template for configureZone and neither stored on the
# encoder nor passed to x265_param_free). One block leaks per encoder open,
# regardless of how the encoder is used. Fixed upstream after 3.5.
leak:x265_encoder_open
